      "page": 320,
      "ruku": 276,
      "hizbQuarter": 128,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2471,
      "text": "Allah said, “Get down, both of you, from here altogether [with Satan] as enemies to one another. Then when there comes to you guidance from Me, whoever follows My guidance will neither go astray nor fall into misery[46].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 123,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 320,
      "ruku": 276,
      "hizbQuarter": 128,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2472,
      "text": "But whoever turns away from My Reminder[47] will have a miserable life, and on the Day of Resurrection We will raise him blind.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 124,
